# Default merge strategy

Prefer **squash merge** unless preserving commit-by-commit history has clear review, rollback, or auditing value. If not squashing, state the reason in the PR description before merging.

**Authority:** [`CONTRIBUTING.md`](../../CONTRIBUTING.md) (feature-branch policy).
